// Real QR code bitmap generated by `qrencode -t ASCII -m 0` (not handwritten fake data).
// Content is the self-hosted relay pairing link below. Used to test the full pipeline
// in unit tests: RGBA frame → jsQR → pairing link. Wiring errors (e.g., RGBA component
// order, swapped dimensions) won't error, only silently decode to nothing — a silent
// failure that's extremely hard to track down on a real device.
//
// `#` = dark module, `.` = light. 37 x 37.

